  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5601.07 \"Law enforcement agency\" includes a sheriff or deputy sheriff of any county, a state police officer, a constable or police officer of any city or town, an offic",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5601.07 \"Law enforcement agency\" includes a sheriff or deputy sheriff of any county, a state police officer, a constable or police officer of any city or town, an official of any jail or corrections institution, a conservation officer, a probation or parole officer, or any federal law enforcement officer.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
